{
	"$description": "Norviq design tokens (DTCG). Master: norviq-web-v2/design/tokens.json; byte copy in norviq-ios financeplan/Design/tokens.json. Colour $value is the light value, $extensions.norviq.dark the dark one; css and ios name the web custom property and iOS colour set it generates. Alpha is the last hex byte, round(alpha × 255): web emits whole percent, iOS round(byte / 255, 2). Dimensions are px (1px = 1pt on iOS). Edit here, run `bun run tokens`, copy the file to iOS.",
